; Rim-overflow path: the surge tank is open-topped (rim at 1.50 m). The weir crest
; sits AT the rim (= ST MaxDepth), so it is transparent to the solution (levels only
; drop in this withdrawal experiment); it exists because the engine (legacy ERROR 145
; parity) requires >= 1 outfall node.
